@baseUrl = http://localhost:5203
@token = REEMPLAZAR_JWT
@userId = REEMPLAZAR_USER_ID
@clienteId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@articuloId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@empresa.com",
  "password": "Secreto123"
}

### Registro multipart sin archivos opcionales
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=OceanOneBoundary

--OceanOneBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Rnc"

101234567
--OceanOneBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="RazonSocial"

Empresa Ejemplo SRL
--OceanOneBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="ActividadEconomica"

Servicios
--OceanOneBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="ProvinciaId"

010000
--OceanOneBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="MunicipioId"

010101
--OceanOneBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="FullName"

Ada Lovelace
--OceanOneBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="PhoneNumber"

8095550101
--OceanOneBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="UserName"

adalovelace
--OceanOneBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Email"

ada@empresa.com
--OceanOneBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="ConfirmEmail"

ada@empresa.com
--OceanOneBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Password"

Secreto123
--OceanOneBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="ConfirmPassword"

Secreto123
--OceanOneBoundary--

### Solicitar recuperación de contraseña
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@empresa.com"
}

### Restablecer contraseña
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@empresa.com",
  "resetCode": "REEMPLAZAR_TOKEN",
  "newPassword": "NuevaClave123"
}

### NO DISPONIBLE: DgiiController está excluido del build; responde 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dgii/consulta-rnc?rnc=101234567

### NO DISPONIBLE: usar GET /api/provincias
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dgii/consulta-provincias

### NO DISPONIBLE: usar GET /api/municipios/provincia/{codigoProvincia}
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dgii/consulta-municipios?provincia=010000

### Provincias activas
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/provincias

### Municipios activos por provincia
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/municipios/provincia/010000

### Comprobar autenticación y claims
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tokeninspector/check-auth
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ver claims individuales
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tokeninspector/claims
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar roles (actualmente público)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/roles/list

### Crear rol: el body es un string JSON
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/roles/create
Content-Type: application/json

"TENANT_LISTS_ADMIN"

### Asignar rol (actualmente público)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/roles/assign?userId={{userId}}&roleName=TENANT_LISTS_ADMIN

### Consultar roles del usuario (actualmente público)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/roles/user/{{userId}}/roles

### Remover rol (actualmente público)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/roles/remove?userId={{userId}}&roleName=TENANT_LISTS_ADMIN

### Eliminar rol (actualmente público; DELETE puede ser bloqueado por CORS)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/roles/delete/TENANT_LISTS_ADMIN

### Clientes activos
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/clientes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Clientes incluyendo inactivos
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/clientes?incluirInactivos=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear cliente
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/clientes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

< ./cliente.json

### Actualizar cliente
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/clientes/{{clienteId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

< ./cliente.json

### Desactivar cliente
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/clientes/{{clienteId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Artículos activos
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/articulos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear artículo
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/articulos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

< ./articulo.json

### Actualizar artículo
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/articulos/{{articuloId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

< ./articulo.json

### Desactivar artículo
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/articulos/{{articuloId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Catálogo de indicadores de facturación
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/indicadoresfacturacion

### Buscar documentos fiscales
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/documentosfiscales/search?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Emitir e-CF desde JSON
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ecf/documentofiscal
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/xml

< ./ecf-documento.json

### Consultar TrackId
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ecf/consultartrackid?trackId=REEMPLAZAR_TRACK_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: text/xml

### Descargar PDF Base64
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ecf/downloads/E310000000001
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
